    "Id": "chassisdef_trinity_TRI-YL-BC3",
    "Name": "Trinity",
    "Details": "This experimental model carries a Battle Armor-scale C3 computer. These suits are generally equipped with \"David\" Light Gauss Rifles.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Ambusher</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.908</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can mount Omni units, can melee, can swarm.</b></color>",
